(text_box "1. Function: TP32-TP46 are 15 plated half-hole (castellated) test pads on the board edge: a 0.60 mm plated hole centred on the board outline, 1.10 mm round copper on the top and bottom faces, solder mask open on both faces, no part, no paste. They bring out the nets that the header of test frame V4 carried, so a probe tip, a pogo pin or a soldered wire reaches them from the edge or from either face. North edge: STIM_CHB / STIM_EN / STIM_CLK / STIM_START_SHARED (TP32-TP35), GND (TP36), ASIC_AC_IN (TP37). South edge: STIM_POS_12V (TP38), GND (TP39), EN_ASIC_RAILS (TP40), GND (TP41), STIM_NEG_12V (TP42). East edge: AGND (TP43), STIM_PRE_NEG (TP44), VIN_3V3 (TP45). West edge: ASIC_VDD_CGEN (TP46). Positions: PROBE_MAP.csv in the layout V26 record.\n\n2. Source / changes: Designed by Claude on Howard's request of 23 Nov 2026 (Test Pad Plan B, option C of the edge-pad sketches), after his professor suggested test pads on the board edge; no manufacturer reference circuit. Pad geometry after JLCPCB, Castellated PCBs: Introduction and Design Requirements (updated 10 Nov 2026), section Design Requirements and Table 2 (hole 0.6 mm or more, hole-to-hole gap 0.6 mm or more, 3 mm or more from a board corner, pad 0.5 mm or more into the board, ENIG), https://jlcpcb.com/blog/castellated-pcbs-introduction-and-design-requirements , and JLCPCB help, What is Castellated holes / half-holes? (updated 16 Nov 2026), https://jlcpcb.com/help/article/what-is-castellated-holes . New in V45: TP32-TP46 on existing nets; no new net, no part moved, no earlier test pad removed. Not placed: ASIC_VDD_ADC (no edge position is clear of other nets on all six layers; use TP12). Unverified: JLC has not been asked whether half holes can be combined with this HDI stack-up; probe loading on the STIM and AC_IN lines (stubs up to 2.3 mm); the half holes for +12 V, -12 V and STIM_PRE_NEG are bare metal at the board edge." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 312 97 0) (size 92 53) (margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5) (stroke (width 0.3) (type solid)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "26003b0b-06af-5bd7-b488-e5e9c63ab3f0"))

